  "prefLabel": "Lab 522.03 Role of Complainants in Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 522.03 Role of Complainants in Disciplinary Hearings. A complainant shall have no role in the disciplinary hearing of the CVRP or CVRPI complained against other than that of witness unless the complainant petitions for, and is granted, the right to intervene.\n\nSource. #9287, eff 10-1-08; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab500.html"
